@startuml
autonumber

participant "DevOps Engineer" as DevOps
participant "Script CI/CD" as CICD
participant "Registry Docker" as DockerReg
participant "Cluster Kubernetes" as K8s
participant "Service Agent" as AgentSvc
participant "Service LinUCB" as LinUCBSvc
participant "Load Balancer" as LB
participant "Health Checker" as HealthCheck

DevOps -> CICD : Déclenchement: git push main
activate CICD

CICD -> CICD : Build images Docker
CICD -> DockerReg : Push guidni-agent:v2.4.0
CICD -> DockerReg : Push guidni-linucb:v2.4.0
DockerReg --> CICD : Images taguées

CICD -> K8s : Apply deployment.yaml
activate K8s
K8s -> K8s : Rolling update Agent Service
K8s -> AgentSvc : Création nouveaux pods
AgentSvc -> AgentSvc : Pull image + démarrage
AgentSvc --> K8s : Pods ready (3/3)

K8s -> K8s : Rolling update LinUCB Service
K8s -> LinUCBSvc : Création nouveaux pods
LinUCBSvc -> LinUCBSvc : Pull image + démarrage
LinUCBSvc --> K8s : Pods ready (2/2)

K8s -> LB : Mise à jour endpoints
LB -> LB : Routing vers nouveaux pods
LB --> K8s : Traffic switché

K8s -> HealthCheck : Vérification santé services
activate HealthCheck
HealthCheck -> AgentSvc : GET /health
AgentSvc --> HealthCheck : 200 OK {status: "healthy", uptime: 12s}

HealthCheck -> AgentSvc : GET /ready
AgentSvc --> HealthCheck : 200 OK {status: "ready", deps: "ok"}

HealthCheck -> LinUCBSvc : GET /health
LinUCBSvc --> HealthCheck : 200 OK {status: "healthy", model_version: "v2025-01-15"}

HealthCheck -> LinUCBSvc : GET /metrics
LinUCBSvc --> HealthCheck : 200 OK {requests_total, latency_p95, errors_rate}

alt Tous checks OK
    HealthCheck --> K8s : [OK] Déploiement validé
    K8S --> CICD : Succès déploiement
else Check échoué
    HealthCheck --> K8s : [FAIL] Échec health check
    K8s -> K8s : Rollback automatique
    K8s --> CICD : Alert: rollback triggered
end
deactivate HealthCheck

CICD --> DevOps : Notification déploiement terminé
deactivate CICD

note right of AgentSvc
  Deployment: 3 replicas
  Resources: 2 CPU, 4GB RAM
  Auto-scaling: 3-10 pods
end note

note left of LinUCBSvc
  Deployment: 2 replicas
  Resources: 4 CPU, 8GB RAM
  GPU optionnel pour inférence
end note

note bottom of HealthCheck
  Endpoints exposés:
  - /health (liveness)
  - /ready (readiness)
  - /metrics (Prometheus)
  Intervalle: 10s
end note

@enduml
